@url = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI

### Listar todos
GET {{url}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial por vehículo
GET {{url}}/viajes?vehiculo_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial por conductor
GET {{url}}/viajes?conductor_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear
POST {{url}}/viajes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "vehiculo_id": 1, "conductor_id": 1, "fecha_salida": "2026-11-01", "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-02",
  "origen": "La Rioja", "destino": "Córdoba", "kilometros": 440, "observaciones": "Sin novedades" }

### Actualizar
PUT {{url}}/viajes/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "vehiculo_id": 1, "conductor_id": 1, "fecha_salida": "2026-11-01", "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-02",
  "origen": "La Rioja", "destino": "Córdoba", "kilometros": 450, "observaciones": "Ajuste de km" }

### Eliminar
DELETE {{url}}/viajes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
